  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The magnetic connector is an electronic component that utilizes the principle of magnetism to achieve connection. It consists of a male part and a female part. When in use, the male and female parts will automatically attract and connect together due to the magnetic force when they are close to each other, thus enabling the transmission of signals or electricity."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/f33e7c66e6ca4c7ab56cc83e44fb7ae3/7mm_Round_Magnetic_Connector_(2Pair)_-XE003_3D_Model.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <span>3D Model</span> </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>The magnetic connector is an electronic component that utilizes the principle of magnetism to achieve connection. It consists of a male part and a female part. When in use, the male and female parts will automatically attract and connect together due to the magnetic force when they are close to each other, thus enabling the transmission of signals or electricity.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div>Material of PIN Needle</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Material of Magnet</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Surface Treatment</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #adadad; font-weight: bold; width: 11.1866%;\">\n<div>Insulating material</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Rated Current</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">Brass</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Neodymium Iron Boron</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Nickel Plating</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Nylon</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">DC 5V 1A</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
